          <p class="mono text-[12px] text-ink-faint">크롭 · 여백</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3 flex items-end justify-center gap-2">
          {[
            { label: "4:5", h: 74, w: 59 },
            { label: "1:1", h: 62, w: 62 },
            { label: "9:16", h: 86, w: 48 },
          ].map((f) => (
            <span class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1">
              <span class="block rounded-sm border border-line bg-[linear-gradient(150deg,#e9f1ec,#f7f3e9)]" style={`width:${f.w}px;height:${f.h}px`}></span>
              <span class="mono text-[10px] text-ink-faint">{f.label}</span>
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 border-t border-line pt-2.5 text-[11.5px] text-ink-faint">
          <li class="flex justify-between"><span>인스타 세로</span><span class="mono">1080×1350</span></li>
          <li class="flex justify-between"><span>스토리·릴스</span><span class="mono">1080×1920</span></li>
          <li class="flex justify-between"><span>블로그 카드</span><span class="mono">1200×630</span></li>
