          <p class="mono text-[11px] text-ink-faint">브라우저 안에서</p>
        </div>
        <ol class="mt-3">
          {utilSteps.map((step, i) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 border-b border-line-soft py-2.5 last:border-0 last:pb-0">
              <span class="mono mt-[1px] flex h-[19px] w-[19px] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-line text-[10.5px] tabular-nums text-ink-faint">
                {i + 1}
              </span>
              <span class="min-w-0">
                <span class="mono block text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.02em] text-ink-faint">
                  {["입력", "처리", "결과"][i]}
                </span>
                <span class="mt-[1px] block text-[12.5px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink-soft">{step}</span>
              </span>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[11.5px] text-ink-faint">입력값은 저장하지 않고, 결과에는 기준일·출처를 함께 붙입니다</p>
